---
// Modal: Escolha de Modelo de Impressão e PDF
---
<div class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-inverse-surface/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-end sm:items-center justify-center p-0 sm:p-4 transition-opacity duration-200 hidden" id="export-pdf-modal">
  <div class="w-full sm:max-w-lg bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-t-2xl sm:rounded-2xl p-spacing-lg shadow-2xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto space-y-spacing-md">
    <!-- Modal Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-surface-container-high">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">print</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface leading-tight">Opções de Impressão e PDF</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Selecione o modelo oficial desejado</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" id="btn-close-export-modal" type="button" aria-label="Fechar janela">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">close</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Opções de Modelos -->
    <div class="space-y-3 pt-1">
      <!-- MODELO 1: Escala Individual do Dia -->
      <button id="btn-export-model-day" class="w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high hover:border-primary bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-lowest text-left flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all group shadow-sm" type="button">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">event_note</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary font-bold">1. Escala do Dia Selecionado</h4>
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-primary/10 text-primary px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">Individual</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Ficha litúrgica detalhada com nomes, celebrante, funções específicas e orientações paroquiais.</p>
        </div>
      </button>

      <!-- MODELO 2: Escala Geral do Mês Completo em Folha Única A4 -->
      <button id="btn-export-model-month" class="w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl border-2 border-primary/40 hover:border-primary bg-primary-fixed/20 hover:bg-surface-container-lowest text-left flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all group shadow-sm" type="button">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">calendar_month</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary font-bold">2. Escala Mensal Completa</h4>
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">Folha Única A4</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface mt-0.5">Quadro geral condensado de todo o mês para afixação no mural da Sacristia e arquivo paroquial.</p>
        </div>
      </button>

      <!-- Opção Copiar Lembrete Rápido -->
      <button id="btn-export-model-whatsapp" class="w-full p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high/60 hover:bg-surface-container-high text-left flex items-center gap-3 transition-colors text-on-surface" type="button">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">content_copy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Copiar Lembrete dos Ministros</span>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant block">Copia no padrão: ESCALA: [nomes]... compromisso às [horário]</span>
        </div>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
